      "path": "python_programs/sqrt.py",
      "new_content": "\ndef sqrt(x, epsilon):\n    approx = x / 2\n    while abs(x - approx * approx) > epsilon:\n        approx = 0.5 * (approx + x / approx)\n    return approx\n\n\"\"\"\nSquare Root\n\nNewton-Raphson method implementation.\n\n\nInput:\n    x: A float\n    epsilon: A float\n\nPrecondition:\n    x >= 1 and epsilon > 0\n\nOutput:\n    A float in the interval [sqrt(x) - epsilon, sqrt(x) + epsilon]\n\nExample:\n    >>> sqrt(2, 0.01)\n    1.4166666666666665\n\"\"\"\n"
    }
